  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T02:12:19.250887Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T23:49:20.937740Z",
  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 14,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db3d99efacf69587",
      "translationZh": "我扩展了 TensorSharp 的 Jev 兼容端点 /v1/systemone，使一次决策请求可以同时使用多种类型的证据。例如，一次事件分诊请求可以包含一份书面报告、一张仪表盘截图、一段屏幕录制视频，以及一段来电者的音频片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65abeb4f85ec0d4d",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个 Python 示例，将这四种材料全部以内联 Base64 数据的形式发送。它还展示了生成这些数据的两种方式：对已在内存中的文本进行编码，以及从文件中读取字节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "473a5d555f026b57",
      "translationZh": "将已在内存中的数据编码为带名称的文本附件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71d0a1d2176f86ff",
      "translationZh": "\"state\": \"根据所附证据评估此次事件。\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f94e70c3bf901de",
      "translationZh": "\"instructions\": \"这些证据是否表明当前存在服务中断？\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e9350eeb76c4be9",
      "translationZh": "\"instructions\": \"哪个团队应该先展开调查？\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fee0a04f35466dd9",
      "translationZh": "\"technical\": \"服务错误或应用程序不可用\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68b78426c6e736cf",
      "translationZh": "\"billing\": \"收费或订阅问题\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f932f7f411ae1f2a",
      "translationZh": "\"other\": \"以上两者皆非\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94af5c61aa0ed9b9",
      "translationZh": "files 数组会根据文件扩展名对每个附件进行分类，并保留它们的顺序。你也可以使用专门的 documents、videos 和 audios 数组。内联附件需要一个名称，并且接受上文所示的纯 Base64，或 Base64 data: URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55422db9be9b83f4",
      "translationZh": "关于其工作方式，有一点细节：视频会被采样为帧，供视觉塔处理；音频则由单独配置的语音识别服务转写。DiffusionGemma 不会直接处理音频波形。处理图像和视频输入需要视觉塔，处理音频输入则需要配置 TS_JEV_TRANSCRIPTION_URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a4b96686fcb6203",
      "translationZh": "内联 Base64 会计入 Jev 请求体大小限制（默认为 8 MiB），因此，对于较大的媒体文件，请使用上传 API 和文件引用。代码仓库中也有可直接发送的混合媒体请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a80fe7295005c183",
      "translationZh": "我很好奇，你会希望在单次请求中，依据多种类型的媒体做出哪些决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
